1267:
A building may be erected, altered or used, and a lot may be used or occupied, for any of the following purposes and no other.
(1) Any use specifically permitted in a C-1 District;
(2) Retail sales and pawn shops;
(3) Taxi businesses;
(4) Automobile recovery or towing services, provided any storage yard much [must] be fenced and screened from public sight;
(5) General contractor operations; and
(6) Mini storage warehouses.
